AFGCNv2 is a historical competition-solver snapshot.

This directory preserves solver.py, solver.sh, semantic-specific checkpoints,
thresholds and the accompanying paper. Its original environment is not the
root repository's CPU demo environment.

For the current documented and tested decision-solver workflow, use:
https://github.com/lmlearning/AFGCN

For a self-contained GCN training example in this repository, see the root
README and examples/gcn_demo.py. Historical checkpoints should be interpreted
with the code, input format and configuration that produced them.
